{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bb36006e86b930e2e6ec68da7c8c3daba31b3f73d0760394935a053a0eeb8ac3","ja":"うーん、ポッカポカ～♪\nこれぞ日本晴れってやつだね！","zh":"嗯～暖洋洋的～♪\n这才是名副其实的大晴天呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6e75dbfceb49e406d9e76ca62fd846356405826025fca8f198661a474de3f798","ja":"いやいや、この天気はもう、\n日本晴れどころか、世界晴れっしょ！","zh":"不对不对，这种天气简直\n不是大晴天，而是全世界都在放晴吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2fd42aa0f2cf9cc415d361b89b0d56ee12b8b3e7c74a899132a31a96a71948a1","ja":"本当に、すっごくいい天気だよね。\n暖かくて気持ちいいなーって♪","zh":"天气真的超级好呢。\n暖洋洋的好舒服呀～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"27140b111b172eea785dc6d631d68db28738fa180a2a47e6cd6fca76075b0fd8","ja":"あふぅ……ミキ的には、お昼寝日和って思うな。\nそれじゃあ、おやすみなさーい、なの……。","zh":"啊呜……美希觉得，今天真适合睡午觉呢。\n那美希就先睡啦，晚安哦……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a05639e7a793b7467562470f517e93dc8c0607c8a093c8109efcc27abd091050","ja":"すぅ～……………………。","zh":"呼～……………………。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c226095eda2d604016f6604e6a1c4000f171328ef17685616dbb83521a152fa9","ja":"もう寝ちゃってる……\nさっすがミキミキだね！","zh":"已经睡着了……\n不愧是美希美希呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"05e6adcc2d669ae21a52e05f574ad47a690188ceb61f6bba746ff22e32398bdb","ja":"ふぁ～……。んじゃ、亜美たちも\nゆっくりのんびりするとしますか～。","zh":"哈～啊……那亚美我们\n也慢慢悠悠地放松一下吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c83867766cfc68fc346b3fbc59e85c73dab2465cb2fc929665eac242eaf534c5","ja":"（でも、本当にのんびりしてていいのかな～……。\n私がしっかりしなきゃっ！）","zh":"（不过，真的可以这么悠闲吗～……\n我必须振作起来才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"3e99ca63c865672aa4a441effd56a11837f345e483c9744d7593c5b52400fb70","ja":"亜美、真美、美希さん、そろそろミーティングの\n時間ですよ！　早く戻らなきゃ！","zh":"亚美、真美、美希，快到开会的\n时间了哦！必须赶紧回去了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"7767a7c4f61e2b8db6cb2b6b2a531e1754acf1a70d7f85d21c87baaac7b3ade1","ja":"大丈夫だよ、やよいっち。律っちゃんにはちゃんと、\n「屋上にいる」って、メモを置いてきたから。","zh":"没事的，小弥生。我已经给律子留了纸条，\n写好“在天台”了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"848ea60037f0622eea4a73f477c3991a77a3ae65eaa2416bac92aa0a63da049a","ja":"そうそう。まだ律っちゃんがこないってことは、\nきっと前のお仕事がおしてるんだよ。","zh":"就是说啊。律子还没来，\n肯定是因为前面的工作延误了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"80d77a8b6e8e7f31430d2efaa2bff0c85b6b0581bad5a42ac2bd419ca53e9333","ja":"そうなの？　でも、遅れるって連絡もないし、\nやっぱり様子を見に行こうかなーって……。","zh":"是这样吗？可是也没收到说会迟到的联络，\n我还是想去看看情况呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"c36bf24ac1bd54c0b09e575826e0f568674c041352cdd78bea6b7532f7721a6c","ja":"いやいや、律っちゃんとすれ違うかもしれないし、\nここは、屋上で待つべきっしょ！","zh":"不不，搞不好会跟律子错过，\n这时候就该在楼顶等才对吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"7b295b4d8ffd6d7c322108459b17413c1c1fcbe2aaf17c2cee3e5b0e2159360a","ja":"ほらほら、こっちの方がもっと日当たりが良いよ！\nやよいっちも、もっとのんびりしようよ～。","zh":"快看快看，这边采光更好哦！\n弥生也再多放松放松嘛～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1384.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"251b9d10f517158f1ad2aaf468e7f5ee17d70c02cf494387daabb7dd20a563c0","ja":"えっ……う、うん……。","zh":"诶……嗯、嗯……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
